@startuml
title Diagrama de despliegue UML: entorno de desarrollo
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #1F3864
skinparam NodeBorderColor #1F3864
skinparam NodeBackgroundColor #F2F2F2
skinparam ArtifactBorderColor #1F3864
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF9DB
skinparam NoteBorderColor #BF9000
node "Equipo de desarrollo\n«device»" as D1 {
  node "Navegador web\n«execution environment»" as NAV {
    artifact "Aplicación React\n(http://localhost:5173)" as A1
  }
  node "Node.js 20\n«execution environment»" as NODE {
    artifact "Servidor de desarrollo Vite\n(npm run dev)" as A5
  }
  node "JVM — JDK 21\n«execution environment»" as JVM {
    artifact "Backend/API (Spring Boot)\n(mvn spring-boot:run)" as A2
  }
  node "PostgreSQL 16 (Docker o instalado)\n«execution environment»" as PG {
    artifact "Base «prestamos»" as A4
  }
}
A1 -right- A5 : <<HTTP>>
A5 -right- A2 : <<proxy /api>>\nlocalhost:8080
A2 -down- A4 : <<JDBC>>
note bottom of D1
  Despliegue de desarrollo: Vite reenvía las llamadas /api al backend. Para producción se usa el .jar con la interfaz
  compilada (npm run build la deja en backend/src/main/resources/static).
end note
@enduml
